# Under the input contract (PLAN.md) a signed comparison of operands
# of unknown range is read in the integers: n + %tid.x < n + 32 is
# %tid.x < 32, so the store runs on the 32 threads below 32, in 1 warp,
# and the CTA stores 128 B. An unsigned one also needs both operands
# nonnegative, which a parameter n is not known to be: the store's
# count, its sectors per request and the CTA's store bytes are bounds.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/micro/setp_unknown_range.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/setp_unknown_range.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_signed( // block 64×1×1 | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_unsigned( // block 64×1×1 | per CTA: global store <= 256 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // exec <= 64/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req <= 5 (ideal 4){{$}}
CHECK-LABEL: kernel micro_setp_unknown_range_signed
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B on 32 threads in 1 warp (%tid.x < 32)
# The third kernel sums in .u32 and compares .s32, read as %tid.x < 32
# under the input contract (PLAN.md), which excludes n = 0x7fffffe0:
# 32 threads in 1 warp, the CTA's 128 B. Wrong output (PLAN.md): the
# fourth compares n with n & 0x7fffffff, read as false where a negative
# n makes it true: the store runs on no thread, and the kernel sums to
# no bytes.
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_mixed( // block 64×1×1 | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unknown_range_mask( // block 64×1×1{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // exec 0/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 0 (ideal 0){{$}}
CHECK-LABEL: kernel micro_setp_unknown_range_mixed
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B on 32 threads in 1 warp (%tid.x < 32)
